<title>INDIA: India's Voltas first half 96/97 loss.</title>
<headline>India's Voltas first half 96/97 loss.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six month to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			(49.0)  vs     125.0</p>
<p>    Sales and other income    7,236.9   vs   6,645.6</p>
<p>    Expenditure		   6,937.4   vs   6,321.1</p>
<p>    Gross profit		    299.5   vs     324.5</p>
<p>    Depreciation		    107.6   vs	85.8</p>
<p>    Tax				   nil   vs	 nil</p>
<p>Note: White goods maker Voltas Ltd. said depressed market conditions arising from the tight money market over the last year put pressure on margins and increased finance costs.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom 91-22-265 9000</p>
